{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-regression","title":"多峰回归之痛：一对多映射从哪里来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations/multimodal-regression","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多峰回归之痛-一对多映射从哪里来\">多峰回归之痛：一对多映射从哪里来</h1><p>给定球落地的位置，反推它从哪个角度被抛出——同一个落点，45 度高抛和低平快抛都能达到。这类&quot;果推因&quot;的逆问题里，一个观测天然对应多个原因，正问题的单值函数一旦反过来就碎成了多值关系。多峰性不是数据脏，也不是网络容量不够，它是问题本身的结构。这篇把多峰性的来源掰开，说明为什么再深的确定性网络也治不了它，从而给 <a href=\"why-mdn\">为何混合密度网络</a> 立起的动机补上最硬的那块地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>噪声型不确定性</strong>（偶然不确定性）：真实关系单值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，只是观测被随机噪声污染，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 仍单峰，一个能输出方差的高斯即可建模。</li>\n<li><strong>结构型一对多映射</strong>：对某些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 存在多个本质不同的合理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 真正多峰——这才是 MDN 的战场；它要的不是&quot;给出宽度&quot;，而是&quot;给出好几个分开的中心&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>逆问题是一对多的系统来源</strong>：正向过程多对一，一旦反推原因就翻转成一对多（多解），逆运动学、物理参数反演、姿态恢复都属此类。</li>\n<li><strong>时序的分叉</strong>：同一当前状态下未来常有几条本质不同的路径（路口左转/直行/右转），分布是几团分明而非一团模糊。</li>\n<li><strong>确定性网络无解是双重的</strong>：结构上函数只能单值，训练上 MSE 逼输出趋向矛盾标签的平均值——必须同时改输出形式与损失函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"两种不确定性-噪声型与结构型\">两种不确定性：噪声型与结构型</h2><p>先分清两件常被混为一谈的事。</p>\n<p>第一种是<strong>噪声型不确定性</strong>（也叫偶然不确定性）：真实关系是单值的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，只是观测被随机噪声污染，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=g(x)+\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 仍是单峰，围着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 抖动。给它建模，一个能输出方差的单高斯就够了，谈不上&quot;多峰&quot;。</p>\n<p>第二种是<strong>结构型的一对多映射</strong>：对某些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，存在多个本质不同的合理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是真正的多峰。这才是 MDN 的战场。区别很关键——噪声型只需要模型&quot;给出宽度&quot;，结构型需要模型&quot;给出好几个分开的中心&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>噪声型不确定性</th>\n<th>结构型一对多映射</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 形状</td>\n<td>单峰</td>\n<td>多峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根源</td>\n<td>观测噪声、测量误差</td>\n<td>问题本身多值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单高斯能否建模</td>\n<td>能（估方差即可）</td>\n<td>不能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件均值是否可用</td>\n<td>通常可用</td>\n<td>落在峰间谷底，不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型例子</td>\n<td>传感器读数抖动</td>\n<td>逆运动学、轨迹分叉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"逆问题-正函数一反就多值\">逆问题：正函数一反就多值</h2><p>多峰性最系统的来源是逆问题。许多正向过程是多对一的：多个不同的原因产生同一个结果。一旦你想从结果反推原因，多对一就翻转成一对多。</p>\n<p>考虑一个玩具例子：正向映射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x=y+0.3\\sin(2\\pi y)+\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 平滑地映到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。正向看，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 对应一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，好学得很。可把数据轴对调，改学 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的中段，同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 会命中三个不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。Bishop 正是用这个&quot;S 形翻折&quot;的合成数据演示 MDN：普通网络学出一条穿过三支中间的平庸曲线，MDN 则在中段清晰地分出三个分量。</p>\n<p>工程里这类逆问题遍地都是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>逆运动学</strong>：给末端执行器的目标位姿，求各关节角度。冗余自由度的机械臂有无穷多组解，离散地看则是&quot;肘上/肘下&quot;等有限个构型分支——详见 <a href=\"../practice/mdn-applications\">应用</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>物理参数反演</strong>：从观测光谱反推材料成分，从地震波反推地层结构，简并解普遍存在。</li>\n<li><strong>感知反推</strong>：从 2D 投影恢复 3D 姿态，深度歧义天然导致多解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"轨迹分叉-未来本就有好几个\">轨迹分叉：未来本就有好几个</h2><p>时间序列预测是另一大多峰源头。行人走到路口，下一秒的位置分布不是一团模糊，而是几团分明——左转、右转、直行各是一个模式，之间是他几乎不会出现的位置。用单高斯去套，均值会落在路口正中，方差被撑得极大以勉强覆盖所有分支，得到一个既不准又过度悲观的预测。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  NOW[&quot;当前状态 x&lt;br/&gt;行人在路口&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;模式1:左转&quot;]&#10;  NOW --&gt; B2[&quot;模式2:直行&quot;]&#10;  NOW --&gt; B3[&quot;模式3:右转&quot;]&#10;  B1 --&gt; MDN[&quot;MDN:三个分量&lt;br/&gt;π₁,π₂,π₃ 各据一方&quot;]&#10;  B2 --&gt; MDN&#10;  B3 --&gt; MDN&#10;  NOW --&gt; MSE[&quot;单高斯:一个宽峰&lt;br/&gt;均值落在路口中央&quot;]&#10;  MSE --&gt; BAD[&quot;预测行人撞上路中花坛&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  NOW[\"当前状态 x&lt;br/&gt;行人在路口\"] --&gt; B1[\"模式1:左转\"]\n  NOW --&gt; B2[\"模式2:直行\"]\n  NOW --&gt; B3[\"模式3:右转\"]\n  B1 --&gt; MDN[\"MDN:三个分量&lt;br/&gt;π₁,π₂,π₃ 各据一方\"]\n  B2 --&gt; MDN\n  B3 --&gt; MDN\n  NOW --&gt; MSE[\"单高斯:一个宽峰&lt;br/&gt;均值落在路口中央\"]\n  MSE --&gt; BAD[\"预测行人撞上路中花坛\"]</pre><p>这也是自动驾驶、行人轨迹预测把 MDN 当主力工具的原因。2025 年前后的研究进一步用扩散增强的双 MDN 做人体轨迹预测，输出校准的活动区域与多样轨迹（arXiv:2602.11214）；也有人换用 Student&#39;s t 混合（T-DistNet，Pattern Recognition 2025）来更稳健地建模轨迹不确定性。这些都建立在&quot;未来本就多峰&quot;这个前提上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么确定性网络无解\">为什么确定性网络无解</h2><p>有人会想：网络这么强，加深加宽是不是就能表示多个答案？不能，而且原因是根本性的。一个确定性前馈网络 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是个函数，函数的定义就是&quot;每个输入映到唯一输出&quot;。无论它多复杂，对同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 只能吐出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。多峰性要求的是&quot;一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 对应一个分布&quot;，这超出了函数的表达范畴。</p>\n<p>再看训练动力学。就算网络有能力在不同前向里给不同答案，损失函数也不允许。用 MSE（或等价的单高斯 NLL），面对同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的多个矛盾标签，梯度会把输出往它们的平均值拖——这正是 <a href=\"why-mdn\">为何混合密度网络</a> 里&quot;求均值机器&quot;的表现。要跳出这个陷阱，必须同时改两样东西：让输出变成分布参数（结构上能表达多峰），并把损失换成对整个分布的似然（训练上不再逼平均）。前者是 <a href=\"mdn-model\">MDN 模型结构</a> 的事，后者是 <a href=\"../training/nll-loss\">负对数似然损失</a> 的事。缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>不确定性分两类：噪声型是单峰、只需估方差；结构型一对多映射才是真多峰，是 MDN 要解决的问题。</li>\n<li>逆问题是多峰的系统来源——正向多对一，反演即一对多；逆运动学、参数反演、姿态恢复都属此类。</li>\n<li>时序预测里未来常有几条分叉路径，单高斯会把均值压在谁也不去的中间位置。</li>\n<li>确定性网络在结构上（函数只能单值）和训练上（MSE 逼平均）双重无法表达多峰，必须同时改输出形式与损失函数才能破局。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>动机总览：<a href=\"why-mdn\">为何混合密度网络</a></li>\n<li>把上述需求落成模型：<a href=\"mdn-model\">MDN 模型结构</a></li>\n<li>多峰输出如何正确读出：<a href=\"../practice/sampling-inference\">采样与推断</a></li>\n<li>跨库链接：时序里的多峰状态建模 <a href=\"../../hidden-markov-models/learning/em-derivation\">隐马尔可夫模型的 EM 推导</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多峰回归之痛：一对多映射从哪里来","id":"多峰回归之痛-一对多映射从哪里来"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两种不确定性：噪声型与结构型","id":"两种不确定性-噪声型与结构型"},{"level":2,"text":"逆问题：正函数一反就多值","id":"逆问题-正函数一反就多值"},{"level":2,"text":"轨迹分叉：未来本就有好几个","id":"轨迹分叉-未来本就有好几个"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么确定性网络无解","id":"为什么确定性网络无解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何混合密度网络：当一个答案不够用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations/why-mdn"},"next":{"title":"MDN 模型结构：一个网络，一整个分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/foundations/mdn-model"}}